direction: down

title: |md
  ## Recent additions in 2024-2026
| {near: top-center; shape: text}

psp: |md
  ### PSP (Packet Security Protocol)
  - Google's L4 encryption, in-tree 2025.
  - Lighter than IPsec for datacenter use.
  - Per-flow keys; HW-offload designed.
  - See drivers/net/.../psp/, net/psp/.
| {style.fill: "#dbeafe"}

drop_monitor: |md
  ### drop_monitor / dropwatch
  - Tracepoint-driven: 'where do
  - packets get dropped?'
  - With kfree_skb_reason, every
  - drop has a category enum.
  - Tools: dropwatch,
  - perf trace skb:kfree_skb.
| {style.fill: "#fef3c7"}

devlink: |md
  ### devlink
  - Netlink-based generic device control.
  - Configures NIC features:
  - PCIe SR-IOV, DPLL,
  - congestion control profiles.
  - Replaces ad-hoc ethtool extensions.
| {style.fill: "#dcfce7"}

others: |md
  ### Other 2024-2026 highlights
  - Resilient nexthop groups
  - tcx + netkit (modern tc-bpf)
  - bigtcp (segments > 64KB)
  - Page Pool memory provider
  - net_iov for skb fragments
| {style.fill: "#fee2e2"}

netlink: |md
  ### NETLINK improvements
  - YAML-based NETLINK spec generation
  - auto-generated bindings (libynl).
  - See tools/net/ynl/.
  - Easier to add new genetlink ops in tree.
| {style.fill: "#dbeafe"}

psp -> drop_monitor
drop_monitor -> devlink
devlink -> others
others -> netlink
